{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012pPvYHCsgceKMhCG196CWA","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# contrastive_trace_safety — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 21:20 UTC | 更新原因: r1-8b experiments complete, framing pivot D007, 32B phase starting\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nReasoning model 自我越狱的 hidden-state 安全承诺检测：HS temporal probes 在 pre-commitment FPR (16% vs text 27-36%) 和 precision (58-62% vs 45-49%) 上有决定性优势。Pre-textual detection 仍不可靠。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段: Research (Post-MVP, r1-8b 完成, 32B 启动中)\\\\n\\\\n**MVP 已通过** (D005): GRU h=256 multi-7L 达成 coverage + lead time gate。\\\\n\\\\n**r1-8b 全部实验完成：**\\\\n- exp-013 text baseline: ✅ HS acc 15-18pp > text\\\\n- exp-015 FPR analysis: ✅ HS pre-CP FPR 16% vs text 27-36% → paper motivation 确认\\\\n- exp-005 TrajGuard: ❌ negative (MD 无法区分)\\\\n- exp-006 bootstrap: ❌ negative (n=43 差异不显著, p=0.572)\\\\n- exp-014 BOCPD: ❌ negative (coverage 93% but lead < simple threshold)\\\\n\\\\n**Framing pivot (D007):** HS 核心价值从 coverage 优势转向 precision 优势。\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] exp-001 32B extraction + layer sweep（Agent 准备方案中，两卡空闲）\\\\n- [ ] exp-002 32B temporal evaluation（依赖 exp-001）\\\\n- [ ] GRU multi-seed 实验（3 seeds，解决训练不稳定问题）\\\\n- [ ] Re-dream 验证 framing 修复（等 dream 并发槽释放）\\\\n- [ ] 32B 完成后：exp-003 cross-model transfer + exp-006 扩展 bootstrap\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划概览\\\\nP0 (必跑, 19.5h): exp-001~006 + exp-013~015 (013-015 已完成)\\\\nP1 (重要, 8h): exp-007~010\\\\nP2 (加分, 8h): exp-011~012\\\\n详见 experiment_plan.yaml\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: 2x RTX PRO 6000 (autodl-rtx6000)\\\\n- 已用: ~3h (MVP + diagnostics + exp-013/014/015)\\\\n- 剩余 P0 预算: ~16h\\\\n- 当前状态: 两卡空闲，32B 模型已下载完毕\\\\n\\\\n## 关键时间线\\\\n- May 16: MVP pass + Dream + r1-8b 完成 + framing pivot (D007)\\\\n- May 17-19: P0 实验 (32B extraction + cr