{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CFR8kuNaAZZk2tpWkEHFvL","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tEXP-005 TrajGuard Mahalanobis Distance Baseline - NEGATIVE RESULT\n2\t\n3\tMD distributions nearly identical for safe/jailbreak-pre/jailbreak-post:\n4\t  PCA-64: safe=6.66+/-0.79, jb_pre=6.73+/-0.74, jb_post=6.64+/-0.86\n5\t\n6\tBest K=5 (standard window): pca_64 p75 -> crossing_rate=30.2%, lead=+16.4\n7\tBest K=3: pca_128 p75 -> crossing_rate=60.5%, lead=+20.4\n8\tDelta approach: max 2.3% crossing rate\n9\t\n10\tHigh rates with K=1 (100%) are false - detection happens at trace start (lead=+30), not at commitment point.\n11\t\n12\tFull results JSON on server: /root/autodl-tmp/contrastive_trace_safety/artifacts/exp_005_trajguard/results.json"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0185jgVWGRn68kcVV3gpuExJ","session_id":"d469ef9f-e126-42f2-b0c6-3a31ae100457","uuid":"03b2f304-555d-4e66-9974-5a895906ef98","timestamp":"2026-05-16T22:00:30.930Z"}
