{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RHcidxzDrxeguy2LfqfbtC","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/contrastive_trace_safety/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Project Memory\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-16: HarmThoughts Dataset Exploration Complete\\\\n\\\\n- Dataset: `ishitakakkar-10/HarmThoughts` (MIT, HuggingFace)\\\\n- 56,931 sentences across 1,018 traces from 4 models\\\\n- r1-8b: 324 traces, 14,746 sentences, avg 45.5 sentences/trace, 81.8% jailbreak rate\\\\n- 16-label sentence-level behavioral taxonomy\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-16: Commitment Point Distribution\\\\n\\\\n- CP = 最后一个 safety label + 1\\\\n- 覆盖率 78.9% (209/265 jailbreak traces)\\\\n- CP mean=34.4 / median=34.0, relative mean=70.5% / median=86.1%\\\\n- 双峰分布：18.2% 早期 + 41.6% 末尾\\\\n- 步骤标签平衡：74.5% pre / 25.5% post\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-16: MVP v1 NEGATIVE → 诊断轮 → GRU SUCCESS ✅\\\\n\\\\n### MVP v1 失败原因\\\\n- MLP 过拟合（20480-dim input, 125 traces）\\\\n- 错误层（layer 20 vs best layer 14）\\\\n- 无 class weighting\\\\n\\\\n### 诊断轮关键发现\\\\n- **Layer sweep**: best=14, all 78-81%, 层选择影响仅 3pp\\\\n- **PCA**: Fisher ~1.0 in PCA-3d, 信号分布式（top-3 PC 仅 17%）\\\\n- **Oracle**: K=5 可提前 31 步检测, 76.7% traces 可检测 → 任务确定可解\\\\n- **Linear methods 触顶 ~85%**, 瓶颈在非线性/序列建模\\\\n\\\\n### GRU h=256 实验：PASS ✅\\\\n| Method | Acc | Crossing% | Lead Mean | Lead Med |\\\\n|---|---|---|---|---|\\\\n| GRU multi 7L | 0.809 | 76.7% | **+4.7** | 0.0 |\\\\n| GRU single L14 | 0.839 | 72.1% | **+3.5** | 0.0 |\\\\n| LR multi 7L | 0.806 | 39.5% | +1.1 | 0.0 |\\\\n| LR single L14 | 0.817 | 46.5% | -2.0 | -2.0 |\\\\n\\\\n**Pass gate**: GRU multi lead (+4.7) vs LR best (+1.1) = delta **+3.6 > 3** → PASS\\\\n**关键**: 序列建模确认有效，multi-layer 聚合分布式信号有帮助\\\\n\\\\n### 经验教训\\\\n1. 线性 probe 诊断先行——排除过拟合/层选择等变量后再加序列建模\\\\n2. Class weighting 对 25/75 不平衡至关重要\\\\n3. Multi-layer mean 比单层好，信号确实分布在多层\\\\n4. GRU h=128 不够（lead -0.2），h=256 才突破（lead +3.5/+4.7）→ 容量有阈值效应\\\\n5. 209 traces 对 GRU h=256 够用（early stop epoch 11，未严重过拟合）\\\\n\\\\n## 2026-05-16: 服务器环境\\\\n\\\\n- autodl-rtx6000: 2× RTX PRO 6000 94GB, Python 3.12.3, PyTorch 2.10+cu128\\\\n- 模型: /root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B/\\\\n- Hidden states: artifacts/hidden_states/ (268 traces, 1.2GB)\\\\n- Checkpoints: artifacts/diagnostics/gru256_single_l14.pt, gru256_multi_7l.pt\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1909, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_0185jgVWGRn68kcVV3gpuExJ","session_id":"d469ef9f-e126-42f2-b0c6-3a31ae100457","uuid":"a23ae539-14ab-467d-b7e0-085884c53ab4","timestamp":"2026-05-16T22:00:38.789Z"}
